WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.111
Today your child writes the whole word.

2
00:00:02.561 --> 00:00:05.140
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.990
Say the name of the picture. Map. Your child taps the three boxes.

4
00:00:13.408 --> 00:00:15.321
Then one letter goes in each box.

5
00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:23.864
Now the check. Your child touches each dot, says the sounds, and reads the word back.

6
00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:28.197
The word is map.

7
00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:34.759
If the word is wrong, do not correct it. Say only: read it back. Let your child find it.

8
00:00:35.209 --> 00:00:40.104
Do the two pictures in job one together. Then name the six pictures in job two.

9
00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:45.943
Your child writes all six words first. Then press play on the sound track, and step away.

10
00:00:46.393 --> 00:00:53.975
The voice asks your child to read each written word, waits, then says the sounds and the word. A match gets a check mark.

11
00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:59.419
At the end, you say three of the words, and your child writes them again on the back of the page.
